{"id": "gong9-2017-08-무선공학개론", "exam": "gong9", "group": "국가직 9급", "year": 2017, "subject": "무선공학개론", "exams": ["9급 공개경쟁채용시험"], "booklet": "나", "answersFinal": true, "choices": 4, "pdf": "gong9-7ac1e4310157", "width": 595.0, "height": 841.0, "pages": 2, "questions": [{"no": 1, "regions": [{"page": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 97.3, "x1": 295.5, "y1": 185.9}], "text": "문\n1. 다음변조방식중가장좁은대역폭을차지하는것은?\n①VSB(Vestigial Sideband)\n②SSB(Single Sideband)\n③DSB－SC(Double Sideband-Suppressed Carrier)\n④DSB－TC(Double Sideband-Transmitted Carrier)", "choices": [{"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 115.0, "x1": 295.5, "y1": 132.7, "m": [42.5, 118.0, 51.3, 127.8]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 132.7, "x1": 295.5, "y1": 150.4, "m": [42.5, 135.7, 51.3, 145.6]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 150.4, "x1": 295.5, "y1": 168.1, "m": [42.5, 153.4, 51.3, 163.2]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 168.1, "x1": 295.5, "y1": 185.9, "m": [42.5, 171.1, 51.3, 180.9]}], "answer": [2]}, {"no": 2, "regions": [{"page": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 203.6, "x1": 295.5, "y1": 292.3}], "text": "문\n2. 다음위성통신주파수대역중대기감쇠의영향이가장작은것은?\n①X－밴드\n②C－밴드\n③Ku－밴드\n④Ka－밴드", "choices": [{"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 221.3, "x1": 295.5, "y1": 239.1, "m": [42.5, 224.3, 51.3, 234.2]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 239.1, "x1": 295.5, "y1": 256.7, "m": [42.5, 242.1, 51.3, 251.9]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 256.7, "x1": 295.5, "y1": 274.4, "m": [42.5, 259.7, 51.3, 269.5]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 274.4, "x1": 295.5, "y1": 292.3, "m": [42.5, 277.4, 51.3, 287.3]}], "answer": [2]}, {"no": 3, "regions": [{"page": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 309.9, "x1": 295.5, "y1": 434.1}], "text": "문\n3. 최대가청주파수가3 [kHz]인오디오신호를FM 변조할경우,\n주파수편이가5 [kHz]일때일반화된칼슨(Carson)의법칙에따른\n전송대역폭[kHz]은?\n①4\n②8\n③12\n④16", "choices": [{"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 363.0, "x1": 295.5, "y1": 380.7, "m": [42.5, 366.0, 51.3, 375.8]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 380.7, "x1": 295.5, "y1": 398.5, "m": [42.5, 383.7, 51.3, 393.6]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 398.5, "x1": 295.5, "y1": 416.2, "m": [42.5, 401.5, 51.3, 411.3]}, {"r": 0, 